#000|Ice Keep is home of the|Blue Dragon Queen,|the Lady of Ice|
#001|The jewelled turrets of|Sapphire are famous throughout|the Realms|
#002|The citadel of Frost is said|to be the coldest city in|the Realms|
#003|Pyriss is a tiny village|along the Dragonbrow|Road|
#004|Horncrag is the only city|of Dwarves in the Dragon|Realms|
#005|Also known as 'Snout', Wisp|is a poor fishing|village|
#006|The village of Brow is at|the start of the Dragonsbrow|Road|
#007|The tall crystal towers of|Whitepeak can be seen for|many miles|
#008|Birch is the only remaining|city of the Dragon Realms'|Elven Empire|
#009|The village of Longoaks is|the poorest town in all the|Realms|
#010|The village of Spineway sits|within the shadow of the|Dragon's Spine|
#011|Iris is a mystical city in the|middle of the lake known as|the Dragon's Eye|
#012|Fang is the home of the|Minotaurs of the Dragon's|Mouth|
#013|Southmount is a tiny village|nestled in a dark|vale|
#014|The city of Teyr is right|beside the River of|Tears|
#015|Gold Keep is home of the|Lord of All Dragons,|the Golden Lord|
#016|Tooth is a dirty place, full|of mercenaries and|villains|
#017|The citadel of Aurax is home|to the Golden Hall, where all|the Dragonlords meet|
#018|Dawn is so named, because it|is the first of the Golden Lord's|cities to see the morning sun|
#019|Ruby is the wealthiest city|in the Isles of|Fire|
#020|The city of Magma is|famous for its|siege engines|
#021|Steam is located right in|the point of the|Dragon's Mouth|
#022|Fire Keep is home of the|Red Dragon Queen,|the Lady of Flame|
#023|Jaw is subject to some of|the worst weather in|the Realms|
#024|Argenax is home to the|great Argent Throne of|Lord Silver|
#025|The city of Libros contains|the largest ond oldest library|in the Dragon Realms|
#026|The village of Typ is|famed for its|trackers|
#027|The meadows around|Wintergreen are the most|beautiful in the Realms|
#028|Ebon's Gap is a second line|of defence against the|vicious Lord Ebon|
