#030|The village of Mirror lies next|to a silver-colored|lake|
#031|Silvergard guards the way into|the lands of Lord|Silver|
#032|Few travellers ever return|from the secluded city of|Beard|
#033|Muzzle is a tiny village|on the west coast of the|lands of Ebon|
#034|The citadel of Darkbridge|guards the way into the|lands of Ebon|
#035|Thrott is a small village|on the west coast of|Ebon's lands|
